109. 
.     post `p_formula' ("criterion `qlabel' low hinge") (scalar(formula_low_`key')) (1e-10) (scalar(formula_low_`key')<=1e-10)
110.     post `p_formula' ("criterion `qlabel' high hinge") (scalar(formula_high_`key')) (1e-10) (scalar(formula_high_`key')<=1e-10)
